ta": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "28613851174895338", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "928249903053781"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4653806338186779", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "01_PlanningChallenge.png", "id": "4292361431026248", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_4292361434359581_4470994930713205742_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E7ow3NZkoJIQ7kNvwHFViui&_nc_oc=AdoSOO_euLwLko2-00Y4v-z8NSgwOguv7r18wXRtUdDH1p3Pt1PxKzx6Y_AQVklFsf4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR46pCu4ojmQAK_Og4iIurC5y2OiCxhTlYaxwjHOH_Yew&oe=6AE9F8EB"}, {"file_name": "02_TrainBomb.png", "id": "2440430976405974", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_2440430983072640_275695806054251422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=deva1HEmWYYQ7kNvwFWGXxZ&_nc_oc=AdrKov7m4UkvX9s4YFbEmLw4z2OImYYf7FwOQ3zBbridVAUx5uSUsIzHx8S2xFQYYhs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQhf5rExp_NAADlhdXESXduU_j0Ejldo7RBrKX2znVJoA&oe=6AEA10E8"}, {"file_name": "Arctic01.png", "id": "1300606715362437", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314660_1300606718695770_7189013550718665862_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V92BTjQNhRkQ7kNvwFtRlxB&_nc_oc=Adq7auADS63ilGJ2itL3UroHZsj4eskffNMJCBUgTPtKIfoNxNkT7Z5UD0GAb4LweqY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT-glZG9LTNHCKwIMzyD8gmMQTqtZ3rr5XrCul2_sCXSQ&oe=6AEA0530"}, {"file_name": "Casino01.png", "id": "836604156184163", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825546_836604159517496_3809464117522935515_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mUzXSI__ADEQ7kNvwG_Iq-s&_nc_oc=Ado7j17REoT1m4VIE2xK-S2jTJ64FUxPeHKKtsU5nD4z7LM3ke-FMBli_Pm1BahPflg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTThkBbKCIlLcd2cRpNPoz-kQik-A9OUwX5CTMGKivLvA&oe=6AEA05C3"}, {"file_name": "Venice02.png", "id": "1296478309284882", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824741_1296478312618215_2950825541445735321_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9E7AFaX1nQYQ7kNvwHnuQz9&_nc_oc=AdrJ7cd1LZ_3f3ln5DD5A5jXGt_rWBHeZ7jm2EZ0lVvEm_EJ1PJ-nCN4ufaUJKNusGI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQEUlt0gbgPm7MQ5k7Uby6mEjHQTi1pE8qDlCSvMVJ_Qw&oe=6AE9DEC9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Spymaster", "keywords": ["esp\u00eda", "hora", "acci\u00f3n", "infiltraci\u00f3n", "rebobinar"], "long_description": "En Spymaster, s\u00e9 un as del espionaje: dirige a tres agentes \u00fanicos en misiones contrarreloj. Emplea el C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., un dispositivo ultrasecreto, para grabar, rebobinar y sincronizar sus movimientos en un innovador juego de esp\u00edas que combina acci\u00f3n, infiltraci\u00f3n y cooperaci\u00f3n en solitario.\n\n{1644152147288684}\n\n**Si\u00e9ntete como un verdadero esp\u00eda**\n\nDesde desactivar bombas hasta envenenar a villanos, ninguna misi\u00f3n es igual a la otra. Corre, trepa, desl\u00edzate, usa tirolesas y dispara para abrirte camino y cumplir con tus objetivos.\n\n{992947180513815}\n\n**Controla a varios agentes**\n\nEncarna en tres agentes jugables, cada uno con habilidades y armas \u00fanicas.\n\n{5429170370555247}\n\n**Rebobina el tiempo**\n\nUsa el C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E. y tus neuronas para perfeccionar cada paso y ejecutar la misi\u00f3n perfecta.\n\n{2547604452403274}\n\n**Entra en el mundo del espionaje**\n\nInf\u00edltrate en Protocore y enfrenta a PROTUS, su despiadado director. Revela su complot y lidera misiones arriesgadas para NODE, la \u00faltima esperanza del mundo.\n\n{1814969916294987}", "short_description": "En Spymaster, s\u00e9 un as del espionaje: dirige a tres agentes \u00fanicos en misiones contrarreloj. Emplea el C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., un dispositivo ultrasecreto, para grabar, rebobinar y sincronizar sus movimientos en un innovador juego de esp\u00edas que combina acci\u00f3n, infiltraci\u00f3n y cooperaci\u00f3n en solitario."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2207383483496320", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "01_PlanningChallenge.png", "id": "828144176547997", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_828144179881330_8841569204037628713_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FTIUnXObQX0Q7kNvwGFahJz&_nc_oc=Adq44H7RQlXSP5HSjosOvTL80MIg2aAlikB2AurL9ms0Q8bspOygHJxBKrdYAZJGBxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSKb04-cW02l9MCbeWoq9ZvRM9w6S0kfK8BF0rKzBXstA&oe=6AE9ED57"}, {"file_name": "02_TrainBomb.png", "id": "1290921349899402", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_1290921353232735_4763071316224883862_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rxKzhBQD7h8Q7kNvwGj-Rdf&_nc_oc=Adr1guPoVN5lThW4OajWijoxW4_fRCgkLNNHmQT_iQrCUXvcLRMkgK4yYHFGUXOdt3A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTuYl5Cbzv8l7Weq81izUILzygCSIDcwQg5uG3LOm8yFg&oe=6AE9F420"}, {"file_name": "Arctic01.png", "id": "2156954648400795", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827282_2156954651734128_6083557595907825992_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nn9QU6xYh4MQ7kNvwG-wiLm&_nc_oc=AdqVIBxMjZXukT_tirzry0WsravyxxcLwCpZpA46wJ1wXzcrQCgDyV-APxIuLZ163fs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQY5CQGBJhYyYvRtnnxgch5Oq64UETk7RGEn8EQD7Bwg&oe=6AEA0FD8"}, {"file_name": "Casino01.png", "id": "967855129324467", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_967855132657800_1858141089707515280_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GGq1hHO0HZMQ7kNvwFUh0sw&_nc_oc=AdpRfgJUc9wrcaoVhkJcOIdI4OMRLVtZ_9tkD0HHexAvQHU1KA9thB1swPfDIr8zBIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT4rxsBbB4VVG5BB40PuqdDD7Eh15pHRPbitu6BAgde_A&oe=6AE9E371"}, {"file_name": "Venice02.png", "id": "1001291575620958", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830615_1001291578954291_5658986239729057441_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Us4CF830AvoQ7kNvwFbwg6t&_nc_oc=Adowjq6o34kp-AQvua8Yn67gIWCNIuJ5V14AF-9N1NLvHgU39h6aJZzwTlbaH2dC9HU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTRkOlmZ-8ysMD6x4LWePf8_hXFp9Aier6dj2CEswq8VQ&oe=6AE9FA7A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Spymaster", "keywords": ["Spion", "Zeit", "Aktion", "Eindringen", "Zur\u00fcckspulen"], "long_description": "Werde zum Spionageprofi: Befehlige drei einzigartige Agenten in zeitkritischen Missionen. Nutze die C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., ein streng geheimes Ger\u00e4t, um ihre Bewegungen aufzuzeichnen, zur\u00fcckzuspulen und zu synchronisieren \u2013 in einem innovativen Spionagespiel, das Action, Infiltration und Selbst-Koop vereint.\n\n{1108441811890090}\n\n**F\u00fchle dich wie ein echtes Spionagetalent**\n\nJede Mission ist anders \u2013 von der Entsch\u00e4rfung von Bomben bis hin zur Vergiftung von B\u00f6sewichten. Laufe, springe, klettere, schlittere, fahre an Seilrutschen und schie\u00df dir den Weg frei, um deine Ziele zu erreichen.\n\n{1115960417821068}\n\n**Kontrolliere ein Team**\n\nSchl\u00fcpfe in die Rolle von drei spielbaren Charakteren, von denen jeder \u00fcber einzigartige F\u00e4higkeiten und Waffen verf\u00fcgt.\n\n{1606900874506869}\n\n**Spule die Zeit zur\u00fcck**\n\nNutze die C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E und deinen Verstand, um jeden Schritt deines Plans zu verfeinern und die perfekte Mission durchzuf\u00fchren.\n\n{1500146195276014}\n\n**Betrete die Welt der Spionage**\n\nSchleuse dich bei Protocore und seinem skrupellosen CEO PROTUS ein. Decke seine Verschw\u00f6rung auf und f\u00fchre hochriskante Missionen f\u00fcr NODE durch, die letzte Verteidigungslinie der Welt.\n\n{4421098351440141}", "short_description": "Werde zum Spionageprofi: Befehlige drei einzigartige Agenten in zeitkritischen Missionen. Nutze die C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., ein streng geheimes Ger\u00e4t, um ihre Bewegungen aufzuzeichnen, zur\u00fcckzuspulen und zu synchronisieren \u2013 in einem innovativen Spionagespiel, das Action, Infiltration und Selbst-Koop vereint."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2080906422608176", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "01_PlanningChallenge.png", "id": "1490114796193047", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823286_1490114799526380_7415860082226191522_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NhAT1cQ4IYgQ7kNvwEVqBU-&_nc_oc=AdpiT_8aHFPQa6YfUIRfLUiP4PejF_Jl4OlY3d4jzdI_Ed0nZQClkq9UkyrBNI_2AlI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQipWaFX78hPkLtJ-wwLdLb_swO1YMCoacifMR8lxBlsg&oe=6AE9F5C8"}, {"file_name": "02_TrainBomb.png", "id": "973850488686719", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_973850492020052_749007368703399656_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zMZcf8JwRgsQ7kNvwFPaj9Y&_nc_oc=Adrg8tC6bCkPJnXamVTv0LUeqdgzkY1yys4l-Ufq_tiqthzXCIv1cIBFvnmYd7wKIrk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQezJrhYZgt_M7_ST08iimCN6EBopHMlcSIZgbctVW4vg&oe=6AE9F016"}, {"file_name": "Arctic01.png", "id": "1449925953011072", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507840145_1449925956344405_7991018526636045973_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w4eG63oL3Z8Q7kNvwHY55U3&_nc_oc=AdrakxzSVUmM1zhNVS8bH05KRhDPE5XjNx6RTK9Vfl0z6XG1rUzpK3B9pp25A778AtY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ-ie2KG7yXyQm0d1u2FqRI2Mg2_Q55Z1q0SSLrTCNwGg&oe=6AE9E19C"}, {"file_name": "Casino01.png", "id": "1661604571774642", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_1661604575107975_8514850386855160248_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EsVk3LTP3CQQ7kNvwG08KlJ&_nc_oc=AdrdCC7U5Ok3zSVST-mniCs4ToNUf5SZ1Cz5698PR0OZmzIm6Hk1M5aUb_zZCX5gg1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQPxYVSi29w28QGyuvBGhkLt4tDb2QrnWPBIwPBxa7k_A&oe=6AEA0E05"}, {"file_name": "Venice02.png", "id": "957413720478848", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_957413723812181_1101770632876340370_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bgfy5ITe__EQ7kNvwEM91Of&_nc_oc=AdqozW2ZkWaqyOK3UeciU5Qk-8qM4BtswO-9mmefnMFj58AIQOHFUakioAQxSH9dWo4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRpu_i2RvfINXwR53bZnf8hpNJFyH5_Tfh6k2fz77pAxw&oe=6AEA0686"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Spymaster", "keywords": ["espionnage", "temps", "action", "infiltration", "rembobinage"], "long_description": "Devenez le Spymaster : incarnez trois agents uniques au cours de missions o\u00f9 chaque seconde compte. Exploitez la C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., un dispositif ultrasecret, pour enregistrer, rembobiner et synchroniser leurs actions dans un jeu d\u2019espionnage innovant m\u00ealant action, infiltration et coop\u00e9ration avec soi-m\u00eame.\n\n{1420308912975035}\n\n**Glissez-vous dans la peau d\u2019un v\u00e9ritable espion**\n\nAucune mission ne ressemble \u00e0 une autre : d\u00e9samorcez des bombes, empoisonnez des ennemis et bien plus encore. Courez, sautez, escaladez, glissez, utilisez des tyroliennes et tirez pour atteindre vos objectifs.\n\n{1724129661998838}\n\u200e\n**Contr\u00f4lez plusieurs agents**\n\nIncarnez trois agents jouables, chacun dot\u00e9 de comp\u00e9tences et d\u2019armes uniques.\n\n{28734890412786174}\n\n**Remontez le temps**\n\nUtilisez la C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E. et votre mati\u00e8re grise pour peaufiner chaque \u00e9tape et mener la mission parfaite.\n\n{1843545970330786}\n\u200e\n**Entrez dans le monde de l\u2019espionnage**\n\nInfiltrez Protocore et affrontez son impitoyable PDG, PROTUS. D\u00e9jouez son complot et menez des missions \u00e0 haut risque pour NODE, la derni\u00e8re ligne de d\u00e9fense du monde.\n\n{1125099940013909}", "short_description": "Devenez le Spymaster : incarnez trois agents uniques au cours de missions o\u00f9 chaque seconde compte. Exploitez la C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., un dispositif ultrasecret, pour enregistrer, rembobiner et synchroniser leurs actions dans un jeu d\u2019espionnage innovant m\u00ealant action, infiltration et coop\u00e9ration avec soi-m\u00eame."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverSquare_NEW_With_Update.png", "id": "2449389782216134", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_2449389785549467_7162089953112563117_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fAogwRvm098Q7kNvwGIQq7c&_nc_oc=AdodnvlpZHoGzAA9IZnhAeLybV6pWT1hnzFulOta0t0YMNENUS3h2gPvYz-laOQGIuA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQa__FUKSkA4vKiPU_hK_RTE1QZMotIMRv6o171KSUZDw&oe=6AEA13D5"}, {"file_name": "CoverPortrait_With_Update.png", "id": "2429796087578842", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_2429796090912175_2796015715507157123_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tc290jMyZb8Q7kNvwEQrapP&_nc_oc=Adq0WQtaNrhuWvCRroMPqMa847B12pwztLt8MtLLY_8xHZ7HkI9jayjP5t6JnWIJRDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTF87ryNWdjeJl7Re0jOHFTIW5D_4TCbULJidSjsLbXLw&oe=6AE9E5C3"}, {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_NEW_With_Update.png", "id": "2143833866225664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827646_2143833872892330_6307784456622403876_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_Hz0Ibm4FpQQ7kNvwGNvcBd&_nc_oc=AdqAk40sdSpKVaVqzyFv-gGJgCGp_FvYxGOdTAd7e_6Q0AdrUlYSMDKhruuPmviss2U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQiVcHKfgCkqZSlr4q716A1VkscLYmZUR-YUCHTNXKnVQ&oe=6AE9EC7F"}